# Wedge with Linearly Varying Impedance

This repository contains the MATLAB scripts used to generate the numerical results presented in the paper

**Title:**
Acoustic scattering around a wedge with linearly-growing-impedance surfaces and applications in aeroacoustics

## Contents

- MATLAB source code
- Illustrations of acoustic monopoles, dipoles, quadrupoles 
- Computing eigenvalues
- auxiliary functions that are needed to run the main scripts 

## Running the code

Open MATLAB and run the scripts



